System Name (Example): SmartLogiTrack
🔧 Core Modules & Features
1.  Inventory Management
Tracks product quantities in real-time and keeps records of stock-ins and stock-outs.

Key Features:
Add, update, and delete inventory items
View available stock with color-coded alerts (e.g., red = low stock)
Record restocks and dispatches
Track inventory per warehouse location (if applicable)

2.  Order & Fulfillment Management
Handles orders from placement to delivery.

Key Features:
Create and manage incoming and outgoing orders
Update delivery status
Track customer or supplier orders
Return management

3.  AI-Powered Inventory Forecasting
Predicts future stock needs based on historical data using machine learning.

Key Features:
Daily/weekly demand forecasting per item
Auto-suggest reorder quantities and dates
Identify seasonal trends (e.g., higher demand in holidays)
Alert when predicted stockouts are approaching

Powered By:
Python libraries like Prophet, scikit-learn, or ARIMA (via statsmodels)
Trained on historical inventory, sales, and lead time data

4. Analytics Dashboard
Gives visibility into logistics performance and trends.

Key Features:
Sales trends over time
Inventory turnover rate
Delivery delay patterns
Forecast accuracy reports
Top-selling or fast-moving products

Tools:

Angular + Chart.js or D3.js

5. Supplier & Delivery Monitoring
Helps reduce lead time uncertainties and monitor vendor reliability.

Key Features:
Record supplier details and delivery times
Analyze average delivery lead time
Alert when supplier delays cause stockouts

6.  User & Role Management
Ensures data access is controlled based on role.

Key Features:
Admin, Inventory Manager, and Viewer roles
Permission-based dashboards and modules
Secure login with JWT or session auth

7.  Notification & Alert System
Keeps users updated with critical logistics updates.

Key Features:
Low-stock alerts
Reorder reminder alerts (based on AI forecast)
Supplier delay notifications
System-wide alerts shown in dashboard or via email

Technical Stack Overview

Layer	Technology	Notes
Frontend	Angular	Dynamic UI with real-time updates
Backend	Django + DRF	API development and business logic
AI/ML	Python (Prophet, scikit-learn, pandas)	Forecast engine
Database	PostgreSQL or MySQL	Structured inventory & order data
Visualization	Chart.js / D3.js	Analytics and forecast graphs
